 got to a  high-level art there i envy you  the first part of your question  the west considers and are you going to  reject that  you say  allow me first of all to answer the  first part of your question  you said that in russia uh uh russian  foreign policy  is unpredictable allow me  to respond first of all with  a couple of facts what about the  withdrawal of the us  uh from the uh abm treaty  uh absolutely unpredictable that was so  i'm going to stop it there because it it  just goes nowhere  putin has this ability to talk and talk  and talk and say nothing that is really  stunning  and um it it i i wonder  does he do this with biden in other  words during the summit did the summit  end early maybe  we don't know why it ended early i think  a lot of it was sort of like what else  are we going to talk about  did the summit end early because putin  was doing this stuff it's just an  incredible filibustering and so  really um unsurprising  but amazing how putin is just able to do  this and do this and do this and as a  reminder  i don't want war with russia i don't see  russia as a unique  enemy but i don't play coy with  authoritarian types  and i find nothing progressive in it and  me  as a progressive social democrat uh  i find things to criticize about the  united states  i'm against american imperialism around  the world  on and on and on and also i see very  little that is redeeming  about governments that function the way  that putin's russia functions but i  don't want war with russia  guys don't email me saying i'm uh  suggesting or implying that we need to  attack russia because i'm not  and if you believe that i would  challenge you to find even one instance  of me saying so  one of our sponsors is rise the  science-based app that makes it easy to  improve your sleep and your daily energy  rise helps you figure out what are your  sleep needs helps you achieve your best  possible sleep  through two core principles of sleep  science the idea of sleep debt